    "regime_notes": "Daily lagged cross-sectional Spearman IC over the available 15-asset benchmark. Short horizons are weak or negative, while predictive power strengthens at 5 and 10 sessions, consistent with the ten-session rebalance cadence. Small cross-section implies conservative interpretation despite the long date history.",
